  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>
      <div class='logo'>AR</div>
      <div>
        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Practitioner — small events & personal plans</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href='index.html'>Start</a>
      <a href='services.html'>Gatherings</a>
      <a href='blends.html'>Blends</a>
      <a href='shop.html'>Store</a>
      <a href='pricing.html'>Rates</a>
      <a href='about.html' style='opacity:0.7'>Our Story</a>
      <a href='book.html'>Reserve</a>
      <a href='contact.html'>Say Hello</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class='intro'>
      <article class='bio'>
        <h1 style='margin:0 0 6px 0'>A short note from the practitioner</h1>
        <p class='meta'>Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — workshops, private sessions, and small-series support.</p>
        <p style='margin-top:12px'>I make approachable, safety-minded scent plans for people who want clear steps rather than elaborate rituals. My practice focuses on simple inhalation routines and straightforward topical blends that come with clear dilution guidance and patch-test reminders. The tools I share are meant to be practical helpers that may support calm, focus, or restful evenings.</p>

        <h3 style='margin-top:16px'>How I work</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Short intake to map needs and context</li>
          <li>Practical blend notes and a safe dilution guide for home use</li>
          <li>Follow-ups to adjust scent plans over time</li>
        </ul>

        <div class='testimonials'>
          <h4 style='margin-top:10px'>Kind words</h4>
          <blockquote>"The session left me with a small, easy-to-use blend that actually fits my mornings." — L.</blockquote>
          <blockquote>"Clear instructions and gentle guidance — I appreciated the emphasis on safety." — M.</blockquote>
        </div>
      </article>

      <aside>
        <div class='pattern' role='img' aria-label='decorative pattern'></div>
        <div style='background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:12px'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Facts</div>
          <div class='meta' style='margin-top:6px'>I use classic essential oils but always frame them with clear cautions. No medical claims are made.</div>
        </div>

        <div class='builder'>
          <h4 style='margin:0'>Try a quick blend</h4>
          <p class='meta'>A tiny experiment to see how recipes are framed.</p>

          <label for='vibeB'>Vibe</label>
          <select id='vibeB'>
            <option value='calm'>Calm & even</option>
            <option value='focus'>Alert focus</option>
            <option value='sleep'>Evening wind-down</option>
            <option value='uplift'>Bright uplift</option>
          </select>

          <label for='bottleB'>Bottle size</label>
          <select id='bottleB'>
            <option value='10'>10 mL</option>
            <option value='30'>30 mL</option>
          </select>

          <label for='dilB'>Dilution</label>
          <select id='dilB'>
            <option value='1'>1%</option>
            <option value='2' selected>2%</option>
            <option value='3'>3%</option>
          </select>

          <button id='buildB'>Make a tiny recipe</button>
          <div id='outB' class='card-out'>Choose options and press the button to see a short card.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style='margin-top:22px'>
      <h3>FAQ</h3>
      <details>
        <summary>Will this replace medical or veterinary care?</summary>
        <p class='meta'>No. Our guidance is informational; it may support wellbeing but is not a substitute for professional medical or veterinary advice.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How to do a patch test</summary>
        <p class='meta'>Dilute the recommended recipe, apply a small amount to an inner forearm, and observe for 24 hours. Stop if any irritation occurs.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Pregnancy, nursing, and pets</summary>
        <p class='meta'>Certain oils are not advised during pregnancy or around pets. Please consult a relevant professional if you fall into these categories. Our suggested recipes come with notes about these considerations.</p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <footer style='margin:40px 0;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)'>
      <div style='font-weight:700'>Interested in a session?</div>
      <div class='meta'>Email {{EMAIL}} or call {{PHONE}} — Book online via the Reserve page.</div>
    </footer>
  </main>

<script>
(function(){
  // Duplicate of the builder used elsewhere — keeps experiences consistent
  function oilsFor(v){
    const map={
      calm:['Lavender','Bergamot','Sweet Orange'],
      focus:['Peppermint','Rosemary','Lemon'],
      sleep:['Lavender','Cedarwood','Roman Chamomile'],
      uplift:['Grapefruit','Bergamot','Sweet Orange']
    };
    return map[v]||['Lavender','Sweet Orange','Frankincense'];
  }

  document.getElementById('buildB').addEventListener('click', function(){
    const vibe = document.getElementById('vibeB').value;
    const bottle = Number(document.getElementById('bottleB').value);
    const dil = Number(document.getElementById('dilB').value);
    const oils = oilsFor(vibe);
    const dpm = 20;
    const total = Math.round(dpm*bottle);
    const drops = Math.max(1, Math.round(total*(dil/100)));
    const split = [Math.max(1,Math.round(drops*0.5)), Math.max(1,Math.round(drops*0.3)), Math.max(0, drops - Math.max(1,Math.round(drops*0.5)) - Math.max(1,Math.round(drops*0.3)))];
    let s = 'Tiny blend note\nVibe: '+vibe+'\nBottle: '+bottle+' mL — '+dil+'%\n\nRecipe (drops):\n';
    oils.forEach(function(o,i){ s += '- '+o+': '+(split[i]||0)+' drops\n'; });
    s += '\nSafety: patch test recommended; avoid undiluted use; check pregnancy/pets warnings.';
    document.getElementById('outB').textContent = s;
  });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"book.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Reserve — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f5f7f6;--card:#fff;--muted:#5f6b61;--accent:#7aa27a}
    body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#222}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 18px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;text-decoration:none;color:#333}
    main{max-width:900px;margin:26px auto;padding:0 18px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:18px}
    .form-card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(20,30,20,0.05)}
    label{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-weight:700}
    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ddd;margin-top:6px}
    .actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
    button{padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:none;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
    .planner{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(122,162,122,0.04),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:10px}
    .summary{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eee;margin-top:10px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href='index.html'>Start</a>
      <a href='services.html'>Gatherings</a>
      <a href='blends.html'>Blends</a>
      <a href='shop.html'>Store</a>
      <a href='pricing.html'>Rates</a>
      <a href='about.html'>Our Story</a>
      <a href='book.html' style='opacity:0.8'>Reserve</a>
      <a href='contact.html'>Say Hello</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class='grid'>
      <section class='form-card'>
        <h2 style='margin:0'>Reserve a session</h2>
        <p style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px'>Choose a slot and build a simple session plan on this page. We will confirm availability by email.</p>

        <label for='name'>Your name</label>
        <input id='name' placeholder='First & last' />

        <label for='email'>Email</label>
        <input id='email' placeholder='you@domain.com' />

        <label for='service'>Service</label>
        <select id='service'>
          <option>Intro Session — 60 min</option>
          <option>Follow-up — 30 min</option>
          <option>Series pass consultation</option>
          <option>Small-group workshop</option>
        </select>

        <label for='date'>Preferred date</label>
        <input id='date' type='date' />

        <label for='notes'>Notes about what you want to focus on</label>
        <textarea id='notes' rows='4' placeholder='Short note about why you are reaching out'></textarea>

        <div class='actions'>
          <button id='submit'>Request reservation</button>
          <button id='planCopy' style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;color:#333'>Copy plan</button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class='planner'>
          <h3 style='margin:0'>Session Planner</h3>
          <p style='color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:6px'>Build a compact plan to bring to your session. It will export as plain text you can copy or download.</p>

          <label for='goal'>Primary goal</label>
          <select id='goal'>
            <option>Calm & steady</option>
            <option>Improve focus</option>
            <option>Sleep support</option>
            <option>Daily uplift</option>
          </select>

          <label for='freq'>How often will you use scent?</label>
          <select id='freq'>
            <option>Daily</option>
            <option>Several times a week</option>
            <option>Occasionally</option>
          </select>

          <label for='delivery'>Preferred delivery</label>
          <select id='delivery'>
            <option>Inhalation (diffuser/personal)</option>
            <option>Topical (diluted)</option>
            <option>Both</option>
          </select>

          <label for='length'>Session length (minutes)</label>
          <select id='length'>
            <option>30</option>
            <option selected>60</option>
            <option>90</option>
          </select>

          <div style='display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px'>
            <button id='buildPlan'>Build plan</button>
            <button id='downloadPlan' style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;color:#333'>Download</button>
          </div>

          <div id='planOut' class='summary'>No plan yet — pick options and click "Build plan".</div>
        </div>

        <div style='background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:14px'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Booking notes</div>
          <div style='color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px'>We will contact you to confirm a time. For urgent questions call {{PHONE}} or email {{EMAIL}}.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style='margin-top:18px;background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px'>
      <h4 style='margin:0'>Safety reminders</h4>
      <ul style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px'>
        <li>Patch test any new topical blend. Wait 24 hours.</li>
        <li>Avoid applying undiluted essential oils to skin.</li>
        <li>If pregnant, nursing, or living with pets, please mention this when you book; some oils may be inappropriate.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <footer style='margin:32px 0 80px 0;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)'>
